=== bowtie2, hisat2
--- bowtie2 -x data/
data/idx 
data/idx.rev 
data/sub/
--- bowtie2 -x data/idx -1 data/
data/r1.fq.gz 
data/r2.fq.gz 
data/reads.fa 
data/ref.fa 
data/sub/
--- bowtie2 --very-
--very-fast 	same as -D 5 -R 1 -N 0 -L 22 -i S,0,2.50
--very-fast-local 	same as -D 5 -R 1 -N 0 -L 25 -i S,1,2.00
--very-sensitive 	same as -D 20 -R 3 -N 0 -L 20 -i S,1,0.50
--very-sensitive-local 	same as -D 20 -R 3 -N 0 -L 20 -i S,1,0.50
--- bowtie2 -p
-p 	number of alignment threads to launch (1)
--- bowtie2 --phred
--phred33 	qualities are Phred+33
--phred64 	qualities are Phred+64
--- bowtie2 --un-
--un-conc=	write pairs that didn't align concordantly to <path>
--un-gz=	like --un, gzip compressed (also --un-bz2, --un-lz4, and --al-*, --un-conc-*, --al-conc-*)
--- bowtie2-build data/
data/reads.fa 
data/ref.fa 
data/sub/
--- bowtie2-build data/ref.fa data/
data/idx 
data/idx.rev 
data/sub/
